{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 3",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-632339654200394725 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=632339654032491493&sectionId=632339654200394725)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWi0E6lAfS_text","label":"ggWi0E6lAfS_text","default":"<p>Photo frames have always been a classic way to display special memories, but if you're looking for something more creative and personal, there are plenty of unique alternatives to explore. Personalized photo gifts transform meaningful moments into keepsakes that tell a story, making them perfect for birthdays, anniversaries, holidays, and other special occasions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>One standout option is Memobrick, a custom brick mosaic that turns your favorite photo into a fun building experience and a beautiful piece of home décor. It's more than just displaying a picture it's about celebrating the memories behind it.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYfPM1SNQS_text","label":"ggYfPM1SNQS_text","default":"<p>Why Photo Frames Aren't the Only Way to Preserve Memories</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrfu9Sl95Q_text","label":"ggrfu9Sl95Q_text","default":"<p>Photo frames will always have their place in our homes because they're simple, timeless, and meaningful. But sometimes, your most treasured memories deserve something more interactive and personal. Instead of displaying a photo exactly as it was taken, personalized gifts allow you to celebrate the story behind the image. They transform meaningful moments into lasting keepsakes that reflect the people, emotions, and experiences that make those memories unforgettable.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggIyFqM9oJN_text","label":"ggIyFqM9oJN_text","default":"<p>Not Every Photo Deserves to Stay in Your Camera Roll</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8DZ8toEDb_text","label":"gg8DZ8toEDb_text","default":"<p>Think about how many meaningful photos are sitting in your phone right now family vacations, anniversaries, weddings, graduations, birthdays, or even simple everyday moments that make you smile. While it's wonderful to capture these memories, many of them are rarely looked at again.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gghUxIH857Y_text","label":"gghUxIH857Y_text","default":"<p>Memobrick gives those photos a new purpose. Instead of remaining hidden in your camera roll, your favorite memory becomes a personalized brick mosaic that you can build and proudly display. What makes it even more meaningful is that it creates two memories instead of one. The first is the special moment captured in your photo, and the second is the experience of building it together. Long after the final piece is placed, your Memobrick continues to tell both stories every time you see it.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjBxHO5SWu_text","label":"ggjBxHO5SWu_text","default":"<p>Frame vs. Memobrick: Two Ways to Celebrate Your Memories</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpiCrK_gfT_text","label":"ggpiCrK_gfT_text","default":"<p><strong>Traditional Photo Frame</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0rD4O5w0N_text","label":"gg0rD4O5w0N_text","default":"<p><strong>Memobrick</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggy1wLx_CM5_text","label":"ggy1wLx_CM5_text","default":"<ul><li>Displays your favorite photo</li><li>Ready to display immediately</li><li>Preserves one special moment</li><li>Classic home décor</li><li>View your memory</li></ul>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXPX4vfFa5_text","label":"ggXPX4vfFa5_text","default":"<ul><li>Recreates your favorite photo as a custom brick mosaic</li><li>Enjoy a fun DIY building experience</li><li>Celebrates the memory while creating a new one</li><li>Personalized keepsake and conversation piece</li><li>Build, relive, and display your memory</li></ul>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAGDP2-GP1_text","label":"ggAGDP2-GP1_text","default":"<p>Both photo frames and Memobrick are wonderful ways to celebrate meaningful moments. If you're looking for a classic display, a photo frame is always a great choice. But if you want a personalized gift that combines creativity, quality time, and a lasting keepsake, Memobrick offers a unique experience that goes beyond simply displaying a photograph.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGLsWep69k_viewMoreText","label":"ggGLsWep69k_viewMoreText","default":"Show more"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGLsWep69k_viewLessText","label":"ggGLsWep69k_viewLessText","default":"Show less"},{"type":"html","id":"ggfANevM9o0_text","label":"ggfANevM9o0_text","default":"Quantity"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwzJU_vt4g_label","label":"ggwzJU_vt4g_label","default":"Add to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwzJU_vt4g_outOfStockLabel","label":"ggwzJU_vt4g_outOfStockLabel","default":"Out of stock"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwzJU_vt4g_unavailableLabel","label":"ggwzJU_vt4g_unavailableLabel","default":"Unavailable"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwzJU_vt4g_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","label":"ggwzJU_vt4g_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","default":"Please select a variant to add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwzJU_vt4g_successMessage","label":"ggwzJU_vt4g_successMessage","default":"Add product to cart successfully"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwzJU_vt4g_errorMessage","label":"ggwzJU_vt4g_errorMessage","default":"Cannot add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1z1LQL3cO_viewMoreText","label":"gg1z1LQL3cO_viewMoreText","default":"Show more"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1z1LQL3cO_viewLessText","label":"gg1z1LQL3cO_viewLessText","default":"Show less"},{"type":"html","id":"ggakbNYZIVq_text","label":"ggakbNYZIVq_text","default":"Quantity"},{"type":"html","id":"ggIRalPQq9Y_label","label":"ggIRalPQq9Y_label","default":"Add to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggIRalPQq9Y_outOfStockLabel","label":"ggIRalPQq9Y_outOfStockLabel","default":